{"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"topicSections":[{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/GettingStarted"],"title":"Quickstart","anchor":"Quickstart"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToImplementService","doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/HowToPreviewAndTest"],"title":"How-to Guides","anchor":"How-to-Guides"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/ServiceReference","doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockServiceReference"],"title":"Reference","anchor":"Reference"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/ValueTranslation"],"title":"Explanation","anchor":"Explanation"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MixpanelAnalyticsService"],"title":"Service Layer","anchor":"Service-Layer"},{"identifiers":["doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService"],"title":"Testing","anchor":"Testing"}],"primaryContentSections":[{"content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" is the bridge between Mixpanel’s iOS SDK and Swidux’s provider-agnostic analytics plugin. The plugin owns analytics state (opt-out flag, current screen, last-identified user) and converts your domain actions into typed ","type":"text"},{"code":"AnalyticsEvent","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" values; this package translates those events into Mixpanel SDK calls and maps ","type":"text"},{"code":"AnalyticsValue","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" into Mixpanel’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"Properties","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" payload.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Two types ship in a single product:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MixpanelAnalyticsService","type":"reference"},{"text":" — the live ","type":"text"},{"code":"AnalyticsService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" conformer that constructs and wraps a ","type":"text"},{"code":"MixpanelInstance","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","type":"reference"},{"text":" — a recording actor for SwiftUI ","type":"text"},{"code":"#Preview","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" blocks and Swift Testing suites.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The flow:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":null,"type":"codeListing","code":["store.send(.counter(.increment(5)))","  → AnalyticsPlugin runs the mapper in afterReduce","  → mapper emits AnalyticsEvent(\"counter_added\", [\"amount\": .int(5)])","  → MixpanelAnalyticsService.track(_:) forwards to MixpanelInstance.track(event:properties:)","  → Mixpanel SDK queues the event and flushes per its own schedule"]},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The plugin and the adapter stay decoupled: the plugin doesn’t know about Mixpanel, and the adapter doesn’t know about your action tree.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Mixpanel adapter for Swidux’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AnalyticsPlugin"},{"text":". Owns the Mixpanel SDK on the app’s behalf — ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService(token:)"},{"text":" calls ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Mixpanel.initialize"},{"text":" internally so apps never need to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"import Mixpanel"},{"text":". Ships a recording mock for previews and tests.","type":"text"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics"}],"title":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","roleHeading":"Framework","externalID":"SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","symbolKind":"module","role":"collection"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"actor"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MockMixpanelAnalyticsService"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"MockMixpanelAnalyticsService"}],"title":"MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/mockmixpanelanalyticsservice","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/MockMixpanelAnalyticsService","abstract":[{"text":"Recording ","type":"text"},{"code":"AnalyticsService","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for previews and Swift Testing suites.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","kind":"symbol"},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/GettingStarted":{"title":"Getting Started with SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Add the package, build "},{"code":"MixpanelAnalyticsService","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" with your token, register the analytics plugin, and start dispatching events."}],"type":"topic","role":"article","identifier":"doc:\/\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/documentation\/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics\/GettingStarted","url":"\/documentation\/swiduxmixpanelanalytics\/gettingstarted","kind":"article"},"doc://SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/documentation/SwiduxMixpanelAnalytics/ValueTranslation